# "de" opens the morning after a day ("luns de mañá") and when nothing stands
# before it ("de mañá").  After a noun, "de mañá" is tomorrow's: "as alarmas de
# mañá".  The noun "mañá" is the "Tempo que transcorre entre o amencer e o
# mediodía" (Galizionario s.v. "mañá"), and the same word is the adverb for the
# day after today.
de
